      "writtenOn": "2021-03-02T09:18:32Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Right now this is called once only when radio is available. I think you can move this to the constructor. RadioConfig is ready earlier than PhoneSwitcher, so there should not be problems of knowing which HAL command to use when PhoneSwitcher is created. Then you don\u0027t need the check here.\n\nPlease test it locally and let me know if this works or not.",
